      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIPPED RACCOON (5) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his powerful win three back, getting around this track over 300m in 17.28. Hard to top on best recent times. WEEKEND SCOTCH (1) took the sit on the lead but levelled up to score (17.68) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 300m. Form should stack up. MY MOON SHADOW (2) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 8 lengths away in third (23.58). Has a strong record out of this box with eight wins and four minor placings from 20 starts. Expecting another good run. CHLOE'S COMET (3) drops in distance and should be in the mix.",
